01:20:28.830 --> 01:20:30.870
but also ask and answer Munir's question.

01:20:30.870 --> 01:20:31.950
Andrew, you had a question?

01:20:31.950 --> 01:20:34.290
- So, Amanda, great plan.

01:20:34.290 --> 01:20:38.070
One of the bits of feedback
