01:25:37.230 --> 01:25:40.890
And so there's a bit of a test which is,

01:25:40.890 --> 01:25:42.690
does the progress we have seen

01:25:42.690 --> 01:25:45.420
over the last 12 months continue,

01:25:45.420 --> 01:25:48.480
irrespective of a financial incentive?

01:25:48.480 --> 01:25:51.653
So, there's sort of a,

01:25:51.653 --> 01:25:54.330
there's some real time
evaluation that's going on,

01:25:54.330 --> 01:25:58.770
as we look ahead that I
think is quite important

01:25:58.770 --> 01:26:01.110
for us all to clock.
- Yep, very good.

01:26:01.110 --> 01:26:03.630
Thank you. Amanda, thank you very much.

