02:18:43.340 --> 02:18:44.550
is really important.

02:18:44.550 --> 02:18:45.870
That if you get this right,

02:18:45.870 --> 02:18:47.520
you improve your productivity,

02:18:47.520 --> 02:18:50.520
which improves your ability to deliver.

02:18:50.520 --> 02:18:53.250
And having a highly
engaged workforce is a key.

02:18:53.250 --> 02:18:55.860
And I just wonder whether
the delivery paper,

02:18:55.860 --> 02:18:58.020
which is the one that people will look at

02:18:58.020 --> 02:19:00.570
because of the HRC stuff, which is,

02:19:00.570 --> 02:19:01.403
so what are you doing

02:19:01.403 --> 02:19:02.850
about this?
- Mm-hmm, yeah.

02:19:02.850 --> 02:19:05.280
- Particularly if you are warning us now

02:19:05.280 --> 02:19:07.440
that the data is going to
get worse because of the,

02:19:07.440 --> 02:19:08.850
- Yeah.
- then I just think

02:19:08.850 --> 02:19:09.960
we should be really clear

02:19:09.960 --> 02:19:12.810
about what the business argument is

02:19:12.810 --> 02:19:15.090
for why this is an essential must do,

02:19:15.090 --> 02:19:16.230
not the moral argument.

02:19:16.230 --> 02:19:18.030
We need to state that as well, in my view.

02:19:18.030 --> 02:19:20.370
But we must make the business argument.

02:19:20.370 --> 02:19:22.380
And my worry about this is we never make

02:19:22.380 --> 02:19:25.590
the business argument
about why a highly engaged,

02:19:25.590 --> 02:19:28.710
diverse workforce is good
for delivery the services

02:19:28.710 --> 02:19:30.660
that we need to deliver.

02:19:30.660 --> 02:19:33.750
And that is more important than 19%.

02:19:33.750 --> 02:19:35.490
I'll get in trouble for this, I know,

02:19:35.490 --> 02:19:37.650
but that's more important than 19%

02:19:38.850 --> 02:19:40.500
because actually there's
certain communities

02:19:40.500 --> 02:19:44.220
where actually the answer isn't 19%,

02:19:44.220 --> 02:19:46.320
it might be 25%.

02:19:46.320 --> 02:19:47.670
In the town I was brought up,

02:19:47.670 --> 02:19:50.277
it'll be more like 54 or 55%.

02:19:50.277 --> 02:19:52.800
But actually there are other places where

02:19:52.800 --> 02:19:54.207
it might not even be 10%.

02:19:54.207 --> 02:19:55.260
And I, actually,

02:19:55.260 --> 02:19:59.400
if the argument is reflect the community

02:19:59.400 --> 02:20:00.832
that we're delivering services in,

02:20:00.832 --> 02:20:02.202
then we need to think critically.

02:20:02.202 --> 02:20:04.050
I think we need to think about that.

02:20:04.050 --> 02:20:08.760
And so, make the business
case argument please, as well.

02:20:08.760 --> 02:20:10.500
It's not there's nothing
wrong with what's there,

02:20:10.500 --> 02:20:12.570
it's an additional point,

02:20:12.570 --> 02:20:15.179
